{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":39,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦的使者"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那时，巴拉但的儿子巴比伦王米罗达·巴拉但听说希西迦患病及痊愈的事，便派人送来书信和礼物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西迦欣然接见使者，让他们观看国库里的金银、香料、珍贵膏油、所有兵器和一切宝物。希西迦把宫中及国内的一切悉数给他们看。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["以赛亚先知来见希西迦王，问他：“这些人说了些什么？他们从哪里来？” 希西迦答道：“他们来自遥远的巴比伦。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以赛亚问：“他们在你宫里看到了什么？” 希西迦答道：“他们看到了我宫中的一切。我把国库里的一切悉数给他们看了。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以赛亚对希西迦说：“你要听万军之耶和华的话，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["‘看啊，时候快到了，你宫中的一切和你祖先积攒到现在的一切必被掳到巴比伦，一件不留。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你自己亲生的子孙中必有人被掳去，在巴比伦王的宫中做太监。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["希西迦对以赛亚说：“耶和华借你说的话很好。”因为他想：“我有生之年将平安稳妥。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/39.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/40.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/38.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}